# Cats are tokens, no cards); Cling to Dust exiles Bot2's Island and draws, and two Lotus Petals are sacrificed at priority,
# so Cling is in the graveyard with three other cards. Its escape ({3}{B}, exile five other cards) is offered all the same:
# the Altar sacrificing the merged Ornithopter for {C}{C} while it is cast puts two cards there, the fourth and fifth.

